                  "children": null
                },
                {
                  "key": "",
                  "values": [],
                  "children": null
                },
                {
                  "key": "The system \"Saquerver\" lies between \"Serquergen\" and \"Ablub\". The usual-sized Quarg fleets spawn there. Killing/plundering them doesn't make the other Quarg angry. Landing on the other Quarg faction's worlds doesn't end with a death sentence when you have their ships/outfits.",
